<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters 21st ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 21st ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>			Mar 25	 Feb 13</p>
<p>		  ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> AMS-HKG	    2.90	   2.90</p>
<p> AMS-SIN	    2.70	   2.65</p>
<p> AMS-NRT	    4.50	   4.50</p>
<p> AMS-TPE	    2.60	   2.60</p>
<p> AMS-SEL	    4.10	   4.05</p>
<p> AMS-KUL	    2.60	   2.55</p>
<p> AMS-SYD	    4.50	   4.50</p>
<p>		 INDIAN SUB-CONTINENT</p>
<p> AMS-BOM	    2.15	   2.20</p>
<p>		 MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> AMS-DXB	    1.75	   1.70</p>
<p> AMS-BAH	    2.60	   2.60</p>
<p> AMS-MCT	    2.85	   2.90</p>
<p> AMS-AUH	    2.45	   2.40</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at Amsterdam Schiphol airport.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017</p>
